## Capture owners (must import planner)

- `revolutCompletionCapture.ts` (Skip / Submit tip=0 / tip / finalize)
- `capture-expired-tip-windows`
- `tipWindowCaptureOrchestrationSSOT.ts`
- `adminCaptureTripPaymentSSOT.ts` / `admin-capture-trip-payment`
- `paymentSessionSSOT.ts` (settlement gate)
- `sweep-revolut-stale-holds` (finalize path)

## Lock tests

`supabase/tests/_shared/captureCompositionSSOTLock.test.ts`

**If they fail, fix the code — never delete or soften the lock.**

## Do not

- Infer receivable settlement from capture amount alone
- Second order / second capture for the same tip-window fare
- Put receivable into TEN / commission / tip / payout
- Enable fold via `CUSTOMER_RECEIVABLE_FOLD_ENABLED` in this PR
